@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy and limits";
}

<div class="page-hero">
    <div class="container-xl">
        <h1>Privacy and planning limits</h1>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container-xl section narrow">
    <h2>What this site stores</h2>
    <p>House layouts, materials, furniture sizes, styles, and checklist templates live in JSON files on the server. Your personal plan — rooms, furniture placement, prices, and ticks — is saved in this browser’s local storage. It is not sent to a database.</p>
    <p>You can export that plan as a JSON file and import it later. Clearing the plan or clearing site data in the browser removes it.</p>
    <p>If you download an HTML report, the snapshot you see is posted once so the server can format the file. It is not kept afterwards.</p>

    <h2>What this site is for</h2>
    <p>Build My Home is an interior planning aid: schematic layouts, approximate paint, tile, and flooring quantities, and a simple budget using prices you type in. It is not a substitute for an architect, structural engineer, or licensed contractor. Do not use it for load-bearing changes, foundations, stairs, fire safety, electrical, or plumbing design.</p>
</div>
